arity Club's president and an easygoing girl. She is Kanae's childhood friend. She is also his classmate despite being actually a year older than him, but due to her illness, she has to repeat one year."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c14882"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"「まずはお茶でも飲んで、ゆっくり考えましょ」"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「うふふ、権力とお金があって損することはないのよ。具体的なところは知らなくていいってパパが言ってたけど」"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「お姉さんなんだから、お姉さんらしく接して、ね？」"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"２年生。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ただし病気で休学していたので、主人公たちとは同級生だが１つ年上。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"おっとりした性格で包容力あり。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ギャング部の設立者であり部長、そしてパトロン。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"家はお金持ちで、ギャング部の備品や活動費用はゆとりの小遣い（通称Ｙ資金）から出ている。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"734","sourceWorkId":"17665","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公たちとは同級生だが、病気で休学していたので 1つ年上。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"おっとりした性格で包容力あり。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ギャング部の設立者であり部長、そしてパトロン。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"家はお金持ちで、ギャング部の備品や活動費用はゆとりの小遣い （通称Y資金） から出ている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「まずはお茶でも飲んでゆっくり考えましょ」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"20875"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"胸围（本版本）","value":"88 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"734","sourceWorkId":"17665","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"身高（本版本）","value":"155 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"734","sourceWorkId":"17665","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"臀围（本版本）","value":"89 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"734","sourceWorkId":"17665","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"腰围（本版本）","value":"58 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"734","sourceWorkId":"17665","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"体重（本版本）","value":"52 kg","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"734","sourceWorkId":"17665","sourceField":null,"scoped":true}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wik